<title>USA: New London-Spicer ISD 345, Minn., won by Griffin.</title>
<headline>New London-Spicer ISD 345, Minn., won by Griffin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik said it won $1.955 million of New London-Spicer ISD 345, Minn., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.21 percent.</p>
</text>
